WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.950
Friday retro. How much time did code reviews take?

00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:05.186
Nobody remembers.

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:08.881
Pointhours. Time tracking for developers.

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:13.950
Click a template: it's on your day. Stop the timer: it saves itself.

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:18.050
Code review? Just the MR link and time. Pairing? A title and time.

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:22.700
Sprint's over: points and hours for every kind of work. Reviews count too.

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:26.836
Your next sprint, with the full picture. Free, no card.
